# Build context for orchestration/runner/Dockerfile is the repo root (see
# that file's header) -- without this, COPY transform/dbt/ pulls in
# whatever gitignored local dbt artifacts happen to sit in the working
# tree at build time (target/, dbt_packages/, logs/, .user.yml), making
# the image non-reproducible and letting stale partial-parse state leak
# into the containerized dbt run. Mirrors transform/dbt's own entries in
# .gitignore exactly -- keep the two in sync if either changes.
transform/dbt/target/
transform/dbt/dbt_packages/
transform/dbt/logs/
transform/dbt/.user.yml

# Not needed inside the image and large/irrelevant to the build either way.
.git/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
terraform/
docs/
articles/
